<rml>
<head>
	<title>Golden Archer's lucky number registration (CGoldBowmanWindow)</title>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="base.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="event_item_entry.rcss"/>
	<link type="text/rcss" href="gold_bowman.rcss"/>
</head>
<body>
	<!-- The Golden Archer's lucky number registration (CGoldBowmanWindow), docked right: its texts,
	     the 12-character number field, Register and the exit button. The frame and the field's back
	     are gold_bowman_bg.rml in the background context (UI/Events/EventItemEntryView.h).
	     root_x/root_y/root_scale come from the dock transform; everything inside is reference px;
	     text is .sharp-text at the native size, counter-scaled out of the panel. C++ focuses the
	     field on opening and reads it for the request, keeps the exit tooltip, the corner close,
	     Escape and the requests; a click is queued with item_entry_press. -->
	<div id="panel" data-model="gold_bowman" data-style-left="root_x + 'px'" data-style-top="root_y + 'px'"
	     data-style-transform="'scale(' + root_scale + ')'">
		<span class="sharp-text entry-text" data-for="t : texts" data-class-left-aligned="t.left_aligned"
		      data-style-left="t.left + 'px'" data-style-top="t.top + 'px'" data-style-color="t.color"
		      data-style-font-size="t.text_px + 'px'" data-style-width="(t.width * root_scale) + 'px'"
		      data-style-transform="'scale(' + (1 / root_scale) + ')'">{{t.text}}</span>

		<div class="entry-btn gb-btn" data-for="b : buttons" data-class-wide="b.style == 'wide'"
		     data-class-exit="b.style == 'exit'"
		     data-style-left="b.left + 'px'" data-style-top="b.top + 'px'"
		     data-style-width="b.width + 'px'" data-style-height="b.height + 'px'"
		     data-event-click="item_entry_press(b.index)">
			<span class="sharp-text entry-label" data-if="b.label != ''"
			      data-style-font-size="text_px + 'px'"
			      data-style-width="(b.width * root_scale) + 'px'" data-style-top="b.label_top + 'px'"
			      data-style-line-height="b.label_line_px + 'px'"
			      data-style-transform="'scale(' + (1 / root_scale) + ')'">{{b.label}}</span>
		</div>

		<input id="serial_field" type="text" class="text-field sharp-text" maxlength="12"
		       data-style-font-size="text_px + 'px'" data-style-width="(200 * root_scale) + 'px'"
		       data-style-height="(14 * root_scale) + 'px'" data-style-line-height="(14 * root_scale) + 'px'"
		       data-style-transform="'scale(' + (1 / root_scale) + ')'"/>
	</div>
</body>
</rml>
